  {
   "parameters": {
    "content": "## Rain Check 1: reschedule notice for a rain day\nPOST a rain day to the webhook (or let workflow 3 do it). Every scheduled customer on that day gets a polite no-fee reschedule notice with the next working day, and their row is marked rain-rescheduled with the new date.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Create a Google Sheet with a tab named Schedule using the header row in sheet-templates/Schedule.csv; paste its ID into the Config node (sheetId).\n2. In Config set your business name, owner email, channel (sms or email), the weekdays you work (workDays) and, only if you use workflow 3, your weather location and key.\n3. Attach credentials on nodes with a warning icon: Google Sheets OAuth2, SMTP, and Twilio (HTTP Basic Auth) if you use SMS.\n4. Dates are YYYY-MM-DD (format the day / new_day columns as plain text). Run with test rows (your own phone or email) before activating.\n5. Trigger it by POSTing {\"day\":\"2026-12-01\"} (optional \"newDay\") to the Production URL, for example from a bookmark or a phone shortcut.",
    "height": 300,
    "width": 420
   },
